WEBVTT

00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:31.018
You've got the popular election process
that everybody pays attention to.

00:05:31.042 --> 00:05:33.726
And then you've got
the elite selection process

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.643
that everybody essentially ignores.

00:05:36.667 --> 00:05:38.601
But in a close election,

00:05:38.625 --> 00:05:40.559
if nobody concedes,

00:05:40.583 --> 00:05:43.268
the second invisible process,

00:05:43.292 --> 00:05:45.601
these extra innings if you will,

00:05:45.625 --> 00:05:47.309
they actually matter a whole lot.

00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:48.601
Let me explain.

00:05:48.625 --> 00:05:50.726
That first set of innings,
popular election,

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.018
it's what you think about

00:05:52.042 --> 00:05:54.268
when you think about
the presidential election.

00:05:54.292 --> 00:05:57.059
It's the primaries,
the caucuses, the debates,

00:05:57.083 --> 00:05:59.018
the conventions, it's election night,

00:05:59.042 --> 00:06:00.351
it's all that stuff.